  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Whether you‚Äôre going for a run, walk, or play, the ASICS GEL-Kinetic Fluent has you covered. Constructed with synthetic leather, fibre, and PU, these shoes feature technical welding and eyelet elements inspired by the archives that offer a breathable fit and durability through every stride. The Scutoid GEL technology provides advanced cushioning for everyday wear, while the FF BLAST PLUS cushioning ensures responsive rebounds and lightweight comfort. Completed with a durable rubber outsole for superior traction and support, the ASICS GEL-Kinetic Fluent boasts a TRUSSTIC support system that delivers improved stability with every step.</p> <ul> <li>Strategically designed elements increase impact absorption for added comfort.</li> <li>Contemporary materials add depth and texture.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long walks, daily miles, and all-day wear feel smoother in the ASICS GEL-Kinetic Fluent. Blending archival design cues with modern comfort, this pair delivers breathable support, soft impact protection, and a stable ride that works just as well for everyday movement as it does for light runs.</p><ul><li>Synthetic leather, fiber, and PU upper with technical welding and eyelet details for breathable structure and durability</li><li>Scutoid GEL technology and FF BLAST PLUS cushioning help absorb impact and keep the ride light and responsive</li><li>TRUSSTIC support system adds stability, while the durable rubber outsole provides reliable traction</li><li>Strategically placed design elements help increase comfort through every stride</li></ul>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for walking, everyday wear, and light running when you want cushioned comfort with a clean, sporty look.</p>  <p><strong>Cushioning &amp; Road Feel</strong></p><p>Underfoot, the GEL-Kinetic Fluent is tuned for comfort first, with Scutoid GEL technology and FF BLAST PLUS cushioning helping soften landings without losing responsiveness. Reviewers highlight the supportive, well-cushioned feel, while the rubber outsole helps keep each step steady on daily routes.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Reviewers often call out the comfort and quality feel of the materials, making this an easy option for day-one wear. The layered upper and sturdy outsole are built to handle regular rotation with lasting support.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-Kinetic Fluent - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Black/Gold</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A591-001</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 44.2</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 44.9</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 10</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 9</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 45.5</td><td styl